1
00:00:00,066 --> 00:00:02,106
Uh, come with me,
I'll walk you to the apartment.

2
00:00:02,277 --> 00:00:06,237
(Beverley:)Oh, all right. Would you like
to exchange pleasantries on the way?

3
00:00:06,656 --> 00:00:09,076
- Yeah, sure, I guess.
- All right, you start.

4
00:00:10,493 --> 00:00:13,703
(Penny:)I've always been curious.
What was Leonard like when he was little?

5
00:00:13,872 --> 00:00:17,252
BEVERLY: Oh, I think you mean young.
He's always been little.

6
00:00:17,667 --> 00:00:19,757
(Howard:)Right.
What was he like when he was young?

7
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,710
(Beverley:)You'll have to be more specific.

8
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:25,130
(Penny:)Oh, um, okay, like five or six.

9
00:00:30,847 --> 00:00:33,097
(Penny:)- Five.
- Oh, well, at that age...

10
00:00:33,266 --> 00:00:37,316
...he was in what Freud would call the
phallic stage of psychosexual development.

11
00:00:37,479 --> 00:00:38,899
(Beverley:)An outmoded theory, of course.

12
00:00:39,064 --> 00:00:43,564
(Beverley:)But the boy did spend most of his waking
hours with a tight grasp on his penis.

13
00:00:44,152 --> 00:00:46,572
Oh, yeah, Leonard mentioned
you were a psychiatrist.

14
00:00:46,738 --> 00:00:50,488
(Beverley:)Well, that is one of my degrees.
My primary field is neuroscience.

15
00:00:50,659 --> 00:00:52,739
(Penny:)Oh. Well, I'm an actress.

16
00:00:52,911 --> 00:00:54,041
[GIGGLES]

17
00:00:57,958 --> 00:01:00,018
(Beverley:)Why?

